      "writtenOn": "2025-07-15T15:10:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we take this member / configuration and make it more generic, as there may well be other LLMs and providers that require a positive seed.\n\nI would prefer that we use the name \"aiUsePositiveSeed\", so any ai provider can use this and we do not make a suggestion that it is specific to mistral.\nOf course, follow this through to the README.md, but feel free to use \"mistral\" as an example that requires a positive seed. \n\nThis would be inline with other changes in the pipeline, e.g.\nthere is a requirement for Gemini to use no seed, so we may introduce a \"aiUseNoSeed\" configuration later on, so it would be good to help group these options.",
      "revId": "289accc649f0d11d0a2e207022f68e78c293bc84",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    }
  ],
